DOCUMENT();
loadMacros("PGstandard.pl", "MathObjects.pl", "PGML.pl");
TEXT(beginproblem());

Context("Numeric");

$a = random(2, 9, 1);
$b = random(2, 9, 1);
$product = $a * $b;

BEGIN_PGML
# PGML Demonstration Problem

## Problem Statement

Compute the product of [$a] and [$b].

Answer: [_____]{$product}

---

## Features Demonstrated

This problem showcases:
* *Headings* at different levels
* _Italic_ and *bold* text
* Math variables: [`[$a] \times [$b]`]
* Answer blanks with integrated checking
* Formatted lists

## Instructions

Enter your answer as an integer in the box above.
END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
# Solution

To multiply [$a] by [$b]:

[```[$a] \times [$b] = [$product]```]

The answer is [$product].
END_PGML_SOLUTION

ENDDOCUMENT();

